  "term": "divergence",
  "definition": "In this diagnostic context, divergence means differences between groups or conditions rather than overlap. Here, it refers to ways autism spectrum disorder and developmental language disorder can show distinct structural language patterns across areas such as phonology, grammar, meaning, and narrative.",
